<title>GERMANY: German trade seeks free mkt wheat, barley exports.</title>
<headline>German trade seeks free mkt wheat, barley exports.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>German state grain intervention board BLE received bids for the export of 10,600 tonnes of free market soft wheat with export restitutions in a range of 13.99-18.75 Ecus per tonne, a BLE official said.</p>
<p>Traders also bid for the export of 80,700 tonnes of free market barley, where the desired subsidies were in a 26.72-28.50 Ecus a tonne range, he added.</p>
<p>-Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
